00:05:10,909 --> 00:05:16,909
High above the trenches 14 days is a long life...This is the 15th day!

2
00:10:21,818 --> 00:10:27,818
Aces High is a action, drama, war film directed by Jack Gold.

3
00:15:32,727 --> 00:15:38,727
The first World War is in its third year and aerial combat above the Western Front
is consuming the nation's favored children at an appalling rate.

4
00:20:43,636 --> 00:20:49,636
By early 1917, the average life-span of a British
pilot is less than a fortnight.

5
00:25:54,545 --> 00:26:00,545
Such losses place a fearsome strain on Gresham,
commanding officer of the squadron.

6
00:31:05,454 --> 00:31:11,454
Aces High recreates the early days of the Royal Flying Corps with some magnificently staged aerial
battles, and sensitive direction presents a moving portrayal of the futilities of war.

7
00:36:16,363 --> 00:36:22,363
Maj. John Gresham, played by Malcolm McDowell.

8
